WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.364
Know what's inside

00:00:01.175 --> 00:00:01.953
an app before

00:00:01.765 --> 00:00:02.496
you run it

00:00:03.030 --> 00:00:04.350
Analyze Anything is

00:00:04.162 --> 00:00:05.317
an open-source Rust

00:00:05.129 --> 00:00:06.614
CLI and macOS

00:00:06.426 --> 00:00:06.945
app.

00:00:07.084 --> 00:00:07.755
Give it an

00:00:07.567 --> 00:00:08.263
IPA

00:00:08.369 --> 00:00:09.182
APK

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:11.447
DMG pkg Windows

00:00:11.258 --> 00:00:12.673
installer or any

00:00:12.485 --> 00:00:13.180
file

00:00:13.702 --> 00:00:14.916
It only reads

00:00:14.763 --> 00:00:15.765
never runs

00:00:15.904 --> 00:00:17.331
It unpacks containers

00:00:17.143 --> 00:00:18.156
layer by layer

00:00:18.334 --> 00:00:19.418
relates files to

00:00:19.230 --> 00:00:20.314
one another and

00:00:20.161 --> 00:00:21.175
works offline

00:00:21.329 --> 00:00:22.272
same input

00:00:22.343 --> 00:00:23.345
same report

00:00:23.870 --> 00:00:25.049
Every finding cites

00:00:24.861 --> 00:00:25.674
its evidence

00:00:25.757 --> 00:00:27.030
which file where

00:00:26.842 --> 00:00:27.702
in it and

00:00:27.549 --> 00:00:28.410
what bytes were

00:00:28.221 --> 00:00:28.740
read

00:00:28.879 --> 00:00:30.034
On Notepad plus

00:00:29.846 --> 00:00:30.412
plus

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:31.485
it verified the

00:00:31.296 --> 00:00:32.782
installer's signature

00:00:33.318 --> 00:00:34.332
Full story on

00:00:34.143 --> 00:00:35.039
the dashboard
